{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52750","headline":"若耶春意 · 许景先","name":"若耶春意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越水正逶迤，艳阳三月时。\n中有婵娟子，含怨望佳期。\n鲜肤润玉泽，微眄动蛾眉。\n解佩遗中浦，折芳怀所思。\n彩色岂不重，瓌艳难久滋。\n一歌江南曲，再使妾心悲。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许景先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}